          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Navuzwa Yahova yamuvolera, “Umurembe gove harara nivi; utatia, kigira siulakuza mba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidioni yumbakira Yahova uvwali hazana yaho, navulanga “Yahova aveeye umurembe.” Kuduuka kalunu, uvwali zana vukikiri ha Ofura, ovoveeye vwa vandu va Viezeri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uvudiku yivwo Yahova yavolera Gidioni, “Vugula ijiriki ya baba woovo, ijiriki yakaviri eveeye ni mihiga saba, ma usambuli uvwali vwa Baali, uvwa baba woovo aveeye navwo, na otemagiri hasi munyasaye Ashera, wikikali ahimbi nu vwali zana; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na wumbakiri Yahova Nyasaye woovo uvwali ku lwanda yilu mu lilohiza lilahi lia magina; na ulavugula ijiriki yakaviri nukugihaana kuli kihanwa chukusambwa; nizingu ziukusambira zilatula ku misaala ja otemagi jiumunyasaye ulangwa Ashera.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunangwa Gidioni yavugula avandu likomi mu vatumikiri veve, naakora kuli Yahova yamuvolera; kunangwa yaali natiiyi avandu vinyumba ya baba weve, kandi vandu vi lidaala yilio; siyaali anyala kusambula mbasu mba; yasambula vudiku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avandu vilidaala vavuuka mugamba mumavwevwe nivanyoora uvwali vwa Baali harara ni vifananyi cha Ashera, viombi vivunagiywi, ni ijiriki ya kaviri imali kusaambirwa ku vwali vuhia uvwumbakiywi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vateevana aveene na vene, “Nivwaha unyala kuva naakori yaga?” Lwa vaali nivenyereriza no koteveleriza vavoola, “Ni Gidioni mwana wa Joashi umali kokora yaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maku avandu vi lidaala vavoolera Joashi, “Leeta umwana woovo aduuki kukuza, kigira yaakotemanyia nukusambula uvwali vwa Baali nikifananyi cha Ashera.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
